## Project-Specific Additions

- The EcoScan project structure is established and should not be changed without explicit discussion.
- All logic must have unit test coverage; tests, once added, must not be removed.
- Prioritize maintainability, reliability, and clarity in all code and documentation.
- Use industry best practices, clear patterns, and avoid overengineering or shortcuts.
